      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. i guess i'm just worried about the lines getting blurred. like if i'm working on a new project and i just \"know\" how to solve a problem because of what i saw at this firm, how can i actually prove in court that i didnt \"steal\" it? how do people usually defend themselves against that kind of thing?",
