      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Defending against such claims often requires showing independent derivation, meaning you can document how you arrived at the solution through your own problem-solving process. Providing evidence of your prior experience or general knowledge related to that approach can help prove it wasn't specifically copied. In complex cases, the defense often relies on demonstrating that the technique is an industry-standard best practice rather than a unique trade secret.",
      "source": "target",
